-- The padeyes' dots of the crew test panel's "Padeyes" page (crewtest_ui.lua): a window over the whole screen while
-- they are on (else one pixel in the corner), nothing of its own to be seen, no cursor, clicks let through; its two
-- templates lend their skins to the dots, buttons of one solid colour (as the slot picker's coloured buttons are):
-- tplDot magenta (a padeye), tplDotConfirm orange (one to confirm: under paint, not seen in the deck's texture),
-- tplDotDone green (one the user confirmed), tplDotModel cyan (one of DCS's own model, "Model"),
-- tplDotHole yellow (a hole in the grid, "Holes").
